<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Payment Failed</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px;">

    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">

        <h2 style="color: #d9534f;">Payment Failed</h2>

        <p>Hi,</p>

        <p>We were unable to process your payment. Here are the details:</p>

        <hr />

        <p><strong>Booking ID:</strong> {{bookingId}}</p>
        <p><strong>Amount:</strong> {{amount}}</p>
        <p><strong>Currency:</strong> {{currency}}</p>

        {{#if failureReason}}
        <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{failureReason}}</p>
        {{/if}}

        <hr />

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            Your booking has been cancelled. No amount was charged. If you wish to book again, please create a new booking.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
            Regards,<br/>
            <strong>Haven Booking Team</strong>
        </p>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
